OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClouding
OL,6,Fover through the evening with some
OL,7,Foutbreaks of mostly light rain
OL,8,Fovernight in the east. Mostly dry with
OL,9,Fsome clearer spells for Argyll and the
OL,10,FIsles.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy to start with some
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain in the east.
OL,14,FOtherwise mostly dry with some bright
OL,15,Fspells developing but also the chance
OL,16,Fof showers. Breezy around coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
