OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,6,For showers at times, occasionally
OL,7,Fheavy, along with some drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter spells. Winds will be mostly
OL,9,Flight but likely freshening on Monday.
